'''Theatre: HM (4-Scale) Speed-Runner''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood: Hard Mode]] in a team of 4 players with an overall time of less than 21 minutes.

Like other tasks requiring a specific number of players, this combat achievement is not required for [[Group Ironman Mode|Group Ironmen]] with a smaller group size.

